# Sample 01 — Mandatory conflict
#
# Two lower-side constraints that themselves conflict: the higher load
# is greater than the lower maximum. The diagram shows the conflict
# band (no compliant setting) and identifies the controlling pair.

diagram "Mandatory conflict" {
  orientation horizontal
  scale linear
  range focus

  below "Higher emergency load" must 9 kA
  below "Lower maximum load" must 6 kA
  above "Minimum fault" must 5 kA

  selected "Selected setting" none
}
